Hello again Andrew and Michel,

Things have been going well.    However, I noticed a new error today.    I think I've checked closely for typos in variable names.     The same LDSCobject will run with previous (simpler) model specifications.   This newest model specification includes factors with relatively low loading (0.1 to 0.3), where previous models only contained stronger loadings (>0.3).

Relatedly, do you recommend a minimum threshold EFA loading for CFA selection?

Thanks,
Dan

